  "description_short": "The gift of a coin to a child is a lasting and timeless gift. Each coin is engraved with the year, making it a unique and personalised gift. The coin can be kept for life, marking the start of a precious collection that could grow over the years. ...",
  "description_detailed": "The gift of a coin to a child is a lasting and timeless gift. Each coin is engraved with the year, making it a unique and personalised gift. The coin can be kept for life, marking the start of a precious collection that could grow over the years. It's a symbolic gift that crosses generations. Whether for a birth, christening or any other special occasion, this collection is perfect for celebrating life's precious moments.In collaboration with the French brand Doudou et Compagnie, Monnaie de Paris offers the perfect gift box: a coloured €5 Silver Proof coin and a cuddly bunny, both made in France. The box can later be used as a keepsake box to store all your child's treasures. On the obverse of this coloured 5€ Silver BE coin, a new denomination developed for this collection, the whole team is gathered to celebrate a happy event: the arrival of a newborn baby in the forest! Everyone has brought gifts and cheerfulness for this wonderful day. The bear, fox, bunny and mouse are brought to life by a selective deposit of transparent ink.*The indicated mintage for this set does not correspond to a numbered mintage but rather to a quantity offered for sale, subject to possible restocking.",
